BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 621.5 Td (Pattern 1: Two Pointers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 606.5 Td (* **Core Mechanism:** Maintain two indices moving across one or two linear collections.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 593.5 Td (* **Variations:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 580.5 Td (* *Converging:* Left starts at 0, Right starts at $N-1$; move toward each other \(used in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 569.5 Td (  sorted pair sums, palindrome verification\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 556.5 Td (* *Parallel / Read-Write:* Slow write pointer, fast read pointer \(used in array) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 545.5 Td (  deduplication, zero compaction\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 532.5 Td (* *Two Arrays:* Merge two sorted arrays into one.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 519.5 Td (Pattern 2: Sliding Window) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 504.5 Td (* **Core Mechanism:** Maintain a dynamic or fixed subarray range `[left, right]`. Expand) Tj ET
