BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 689 Td (* **First Pass \(Prefix\):** Let `output[i]` store the product of all elements to the left of) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 678 Td (  $i$.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 665 Td (* **Second Pass \(Suffix\):** Maintain a running scalar `suffixProduct = 1` moving from right) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 654 Td (  to left. Multiply `output[i]` by `suffixProduct`, then update `suffixProduct *= nums[i]`.) Tj ET
