BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 517 Td ([NOTE] **The flow:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 501 Td ([NOTE] 1. User submits credentials \(username/password\) to the `/auth/login` endpoint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 485 Td ([NOTE] 2. We validate credentials against the database - passwords are stored as bcrypt) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 473 Td (hashes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 457 Td ([NOTE] 3. On success, we generate a JWT: payload contains `userId`, `roles`, `email`, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 445 Td (standard claims \(`iss`, `aud`, `exp`, `iat`\). We sign it with our RSA private key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 429 Td ([NOTE] 4. We also generate a refresh token - a cryptographically random 64-byte value stored) Tj ET
