BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 401 Td ([NOTE] 5. Both tokens are returned to the client. The access token is short-lived \(15) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 389 Td (minutes\). The refresh token is long-lived \(7 days\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 373 Td ([NOTE]) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 357 Td ([NOTE] **On subsequent requests:**) Tj ET
