BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 329 Td (JWT middleware validates the signature using our public key, checks expiry, and populates) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 317 Td (`HttpContext.User`. Our authorization policies then check roles and claims.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 301 Td ([NOTE]) Tj ET
