BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 385 Td ([NOTE] "N+1 is when you execute 1 query to fetch N records, then execute N additional queries) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 373 Td (to fetch related data - one per record. With 1000 orders, that's 1001 database round-trips) Tj ET
