BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 764 Td ([NOTE] **1. Optimistic Concurrency with EF Core:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 748 Td ([NOTE] For entities where concurrent updates are possible but rare, we use EF Core's) Tj ET
