BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 381 Td (Kubernetes secrets or Azure Key Vault\). We use `IConfiguration` abstraction - the app doesn't) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 369 Td (know whether config comes from appsettings, env vars, or a secret manager.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 353 Td ([NOTE]) Tj ET
