BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 237 Td (downtime. Blue-Green: run two identical environments, switch traffic - safer for breaking) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 225 Td (changes but costs double the infrastructure. We use rolling for most deployments and blue-green) Tj ET
