BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 520.0 Td (Round Structure \(Typical\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 505.0 Td (Round | Focus | Duration | Key Tips) Tj ET
