BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 441.0 Td (Infosys-Specific Patterns) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 426.0 Td (**They WILL ask:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 410.0 Td (* "Explain SOLID principles with examples from your project") Tj ET
