BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 384.0 Td (* "What is async/await? How does it work internally?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 371.0 Td (* "Write a SQL query to find [specific SQL problem]") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 358.0 Td (* "What design patterns have you used?") Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 345.0 Td (**Infosys traps to prepare for:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 329.0 Td (* "Explain Singleton - is it thread-safe by default?" -> They expect you to know about) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 318.0 Td (  double-checked locking) Tj ET
