BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 405 Td (system and you can't answer it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 389 Td (**Fix:** Be honest about what YOU specifically owned. "My responsibility was X. The Y) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 377 Td (component was built by my colleague, though I understand the high-level design.") Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 361 Td (Mistake 2: Not Knowing Trade-offs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 346 Td (**Problem:** "We used Repository pattern." Interviewer: "What are the disadvantages of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 334 Td (Repository?" Candidate: "...") Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 318 Td (**Fix:** For every pattern/technology you used, know: what problem it solves, what it DOESN'T) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 306 Td (solve, and what the cost is.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 290 Td (Mistake 3: Over-Architecturing Non-Existent Complexity) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 275 Td (**Problem:** Describing a CRUD app as if it's a complex distributed system.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 259 Td (**Fix:** Be honest about the scale and complexity of your project. Show maturity: "The system) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 247 Td (was relatively straightforward - it didn't need microservices. We kept it as a monolith) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 235 Td (intentionally.") Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 219 Td (Mistake 4: Memorized Definitions Without Application) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 204 Td (**Problem:** "SOLID stands for Single Responsibility, Open-Closed, Liskov..." - recited from) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 192 Td (memory with no connection to actual code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 176 Td (**Fix:** Always connect to code. "The Single Responsibility principle - in my project, I) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 164 Td (violated it initially by having the Order entity handle both business logic AND persistence. I) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 152 Td (refactored by moving persistence to the repository and keeping the entity as a pure domain) Tj ET
