BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 718 Td (Q045: Policy-Based Authorization and Custom Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 703 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 690 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 677 Td (* Moves beyond simple Role-Based Access Control \(`[Authorize\(Roles = "Admin"\)]`\) to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 666 Td (  decoupled, testable business authorization rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 653 Td (* **Components**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 640 Td (* **Requirement**: Data class implementing `IAuthorizationRequirement` that holds rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 629 Td (  parameters \(e.g., `MinimumAgeRequirement\(int age\)`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 616 Td (* **Handler**: Class inheriting `AuthorizationHandler<TRequirement>` that executes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 605 Td (  authorization logic \(inspects claims, queries database, evaluates resource ownership\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 592 Td (* **Registration**: Registered in DI and attached to a named policy:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 581 Td (  `builder.Services.AddAuthorization\(options => options.AddPolicy\("Over21", policy =>) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 570 Td (  policy.Requirements.Add\(new MinimumAgeRequirement\(21\)\)\)\)`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 557 Td (* **Resource-Based Authorization**: Uses `IAuthorizationService.AuthorizeAsync\(User,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 546 Td (  resource, "PolicyName"\)` inside endpoint handlers to validate permissions against specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 535 Td (  database entity instances \(e.g., "Can this user edit *this specific* Order?"\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 522 Td (* **The Trap**: Calling `context.Fail\(\)` inside an authorization handler prematurely when) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 511 Td (  multiple handlers evaluate the same requirement. If any handler calls `context.Fail\(\)`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 500 Td (  authorization fails unconditionally even if another handler succeeds. Call) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 489 Td (  `context.Succeed\(\)` if satisfied; otherwise do nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 476 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What is the difference between returning `ForbidResult\(\)` \(HTTP) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 465 Td (  403\) vs `ChallengeResult\(\)` \(HTTP 401\) from an endpoint? *\(Answer: 401 Challenge indicates) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 454 Td (  the user is unauthenticated or has invalid credentials; 403 Forbidden indicates the user) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 443 Td (  is authenticated but lacks permission\).*) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 430 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 414 Td (Q046: Output Caching \(.NET 7+\) vs Response Caching) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 399 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 386 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 373 Td (* **Response Caching \(`UseResponseCaching`\)**: Legacy middleware. Relies heavily on HTTP) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 362 Td (  `Cache-Control` headers. Cannot invalidate cached responses on demand; client headers can) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 351 Td (  bypass cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 338 Td (* **Output Caching \(`UseOutputCaching`\)**: Introduced in .NET 7. Server-side caching engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 327 Td (  fully controlled by the backend application regardless of client headers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 314 Td (* **Core Capabilities**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 301 Td (* **Cache Invalidation via Tags**: Tag responses with domain entities \(`order-123`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 290 Td (  `catalog`\). When an order updates, evict all associated responses atomically via) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 279 Td (  `IOutputCacheStore.EvictByTagAsync\("catalog", default\)`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 266 Td (* **Resource Locking \(Cache Stampede Protection\)**: If multiple concurrent requests hit an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 255 Td (  expired cache entry, only *one* request executes the backend handler while other requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 244 Td (  wait, preventing database overload.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 231 Td (* **Pluggable Storage**: Backed by in-memory storage or distributed Redis cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 218 Td (* **The Trap**: Enabling Output Caching on endpoints returning authenticated user-specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 207 Td (  data without partitioning the cache key by authentication header or cookie. This causes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 196 Td (  User A to see User B's cached private profile data! Use `.VaryByValue\(ctx => ...\)` or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 185 Td (  custom policies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 172 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: Why does Output Caching disable caching automatically on requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 161 Td (  with `Authorization` or `Cookie` headers by default? *\(Answer: To prevent accidental) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 150 Td (  security leaks of tenant-specific or user-private data\).*) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 137 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 121 Td (Q047: `BackgroundService` with Scoped DbContext Pattern) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 106 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Intermediate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 93 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 80 Td (* `BackgroundService` is a Singleton long-running hosted worker implementing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 69 Td (  `IHostedService`.) Tj ET
