BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 670 Td (Q063: `DbContext` Pooling \(`AddDbContextPool`\) Mechanics) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 655 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 642 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 629 Td (* Standard `AddDbContext`: Instantiates a brand-new `DbContext` instance per HTTP request) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 618 Td (  and disposes it at request completion. Instantiation incurs minor CPU overhead \(allocating) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 607 Td (  internal services, states, tracking sets\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 594 Td (* **`AddDbContextPool`**: Maintains a pool of reusable `DbContext` instances \(similar to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 583 Td (  database connection pooling\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 570 Td (* **Lifecycle**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 557 Td (* Request begins: Scoped provider rents an existing `DbContext` instance from the pool.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 544 Td (* Request ends: Context instance state is reset \(`ResetState\(\)`\) and returned to the pool) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 533 Td (  for reuse.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 520 Td (* **Constraints**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 507 Td (* The `DbContext` constructor cannot accept dependencies whose lifetime is Scoped or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 496 Td (  Transient.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 483 Td (* Custom state held in private fields inside the context must be manually reset; otherwise,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 472 Td (  state leaks across requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 459 Td (* **The Trap**: Storing user-specific request state \(like `TenantId` or `CurrentUserId`\) in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 448 Td (  private fields of a pooled `DbContext` without overriding `ResetState\(\)`, leaking tenant) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 437 Td (  identity across requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 424 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What throughput increase does `AddDbContextPool` typically yield) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 413 Td (  in high-load microservices? *\(Answer: Up to 15-20% throughput increase on lightweight read) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 402 Td (  queries by eliminating repeated memory allocations and GC Gen 0 churn\).*) Tj ET
