BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 321 Td (  to the database. E.g., converting a strongly typed ID \(`OrderId`\) to `Guid`, mapping an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 310 Td (  enum to its string representation in SQL, or encrypting/decrypting sensitive columns on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 299 Td (  the fly.) Tj ET
