BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 260.5 Td (* **Shadow Properties**: Properties that exist in the EF Core conceptual model and database) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 249.5 Td (  schema, but are **not** defined as C# properties in the entity class.) Tj ET
