BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: How do you inject scoped dependencies \(like) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 769 Td (  `ICurrentUserService`\) into an EF Core Interceptor registered as a Singleton? *\(Answer:) Tj ET
