BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 160 Td (* **Covering Index**: An index that contains all columns referenced in a query \(`SELECT`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 149 Td (  `WHERE`, `JOIN`, `ORDER BY`\), eliminating the need for an expensive Key Lookup.) Tj ET
