BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 125 Td (  non-clustered index B-Tree.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 112 Td (* Non-key columns do *not* participate in index sorting or intermediate navigation levels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 99 Td (* Bypasses the 16-column / 900-byte index key limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 86 Td (* Saves storage and update overhead compared to adding columns to the index key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 73 Td (* **Filtered Index**: An optimized non-clustered index that includes a `WHERE` clause:) Tj ET
