BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 597.5 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 584.5 Td (* **SARGable** stands for **S**earch **ARG**ument **ABLE**. A query predicate is SARGable) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 573.5 Td (  if the query engine can leverage an index seek \(direct B-Tree traversal\) rather than an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 562.5 Td (  index scan \(reading the entire index\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 549.5 Td (* **Non-SARGable Antipatterns**:) Tj ET
