BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 523.5 Td (`WHERE YEAR\(OrderDate\) = 2026` $\\to$ **Index Scan**) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 507.5 Td (`WHERE OrderDate >= '2026-01-01' AND OrderDate < '2027-01-01'` $\\to$ **Index Seek \(SARGable\)**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 491.5 Td (* Implicit Type Conversion: Comparing `VARCHAR` column to `NVARCHAR` parameter forces SQL) Tj ET
