BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 467.5 Td (* Leading wildcards in string searches: `WHERE Name LIKE '%Smith'` $\\to$ **Index Scan**.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 454.5 Td (* Arithmetic on columns: `WHERE Price * 1.1 > 100` $\\to$ Non-SARGable \(`WHERE Price > 100 /) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 443.5 Td (  1.1` is SARGable\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 430.5 Td (* **The Trap**: Using `.Where\(o => o.OrderDate.Year == 2026\)` in EF Core, which translates) Tj ET
