BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 559 Td (  node. CAP Consistency refers to linearizability \(every read returns the most recent write) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 548 Td (  across distributed nodes\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 535 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What is Delayed Durability \(`SET DELAYED_DURABILITY = ON`\), and) Tj ET
