BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* **The Trap**: Using Strategy pattern when there are only 2 fixed options that will never) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 769 Td (  change. Premature abstraction adds unnecessary indirection.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 756 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: How do you dynamically select a Strategy at runtime in ASP.NET) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 745 Td (  Core without using a Service Locator? *\(Answer: Inject `IEnumerable<IPaymentStrategy>`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 734 Td (  into the coordinator; the coordinator queries the collection using a) Tj ET
