BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 694 Td (Q094: Decorator Pattern vs Inheritance \(Scrutor in .NET\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 679 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 666 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 653 Td (* **Favor Composition Over Inheritance**: Inheritance is static, compile-time bound, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 642 Td (  exposes base class internals. Decorator allows dynamic, runtime wrapping of behavior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 631 Td (  without altering the underlying class.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 618 Td (* **Decorator Pattern**: Wraps an original component, implements the same interface, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 607 Td (  delegates calls to the inner component while adding behavior \(cross-cutting concerns\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 596 Td (  before or after.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 583 Td (* **Enterprise Scenarios**: Adding Caching, Audit Logging, Retries, Circuit Breaking, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 572 Td (  Performance Telemetry to existing repository methods without touching the original) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 561 Td (  database access code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 548 Td (* **Scrutor Library**: The standard open-source tool for ASP.NET Core DI to decorate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 537 Td (  services fluently:) Tj ET
