BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* **The Trap**: Wrapping an entire method containing non-idempotent operations \(`POST) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 769 Td (  /charge-card`\) with an automatic aggressive Retry policy instead of Circuit Breaker,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 758 Td (  resulting in customers being billed multiple times during network timeouts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 745 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: How does modern .NET 8 integrate Polly via) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 734 Td (  `Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Resilience`? *\(Answer: Introduces `AddResilienceHandler`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 723 Td (  configuring standard Hedging, Timeout, Retry, and Circuit Breaker pipelines via the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 712 Td (  modernized Polly v8 core engine\).*) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 699 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 683 Td (Q108: Distributed Tracing: OpenTelemetry, W3C TraceContext, and CorrelationId) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 668 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 655 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 642 Td (* In a microservices architecture, a single user request can traverse 10+ distinct) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 631 Td (  services, message brokers, and background queues. Debugging errors requires end-to-end) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 620 Td (  tracing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 607 Td (* **W3C TraceContext Standard**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 594 Td (* Propagated across HTTP headers and message metadata via `traceparent`:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 581 Td (`traceparent: 00-4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736-00f067aa0ba902b7-01`) Tj ET
