BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* Hashing the URL with MD5 and taking the first 7 characters causes hash collisions that) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 769 Td (  require complex disambiguation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 756 Td (* **Best Architecture: Key Generation Service \(KGS\)** or Distributed Snowflake ID) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 745 Td (  generator:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 732 Td (* Generates unique 64-bit monotonically increasing integers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 719 Td (* Convert the integer directly to Base62 string \(e.g., ID `11,157` becomes `2TX`\). Zero) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 708 Td (  collision risk, $O\(1\)$ computation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 695 Td (* **Scaling & Performance**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 682 Td (* **Read Path**: High-throughput distributed Redis cache cluster. Cache 20% of hot URLs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 671 Td (  \(Pareto 80/20 rule\). HTTP 301 \(Permanent Redirect - browser caches response\) vs HTTP 302) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 660 Td (  \(Temporary Redirect - allows tracking click analytics on every hit\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 647 Td (* **Database**: NoSQL Key-Value / Document store \(DynamoDB / Cassandra\) partitioned on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 636 Td (  ShortKey, or relational DB with clustered index on ShortKey.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 623 Td (* **The Trap**: Generating random 7-character strings and querying the database in a loop) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 612 Td (  to check if the string already exists. Under heavy write traffic, this causes massive) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 601 Td (  database read amplification and lock contention.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 588 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What is the impact of choosing HTTP 301 vs HTTP 302 on link click) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 577 Td (  analytics? *\(Answer: HTTP 301 causes web browsers to cache the redirect locally,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 566 Td (  completely bypassing your servers for subsequent clicks and ruining analytical tracking;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 555 Td (  HTTP 302 forces every click through your servers\).*) Tj ET
