BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 732 Td (  delivery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 719 Td (* **User Preferences & Rate Limiting Engine**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 706 Td (* Validates recipient opt-in settings, quiet hours, and frequency capping \(e.g., max 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 695 Td (  promotional notifications/day\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 682 Td (* **Provider Gateway Adapters**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 669 Td (* Circuit breakers and fallback providers \(e.g., if Twilio SMS fails, automatically) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 658 Td (  failover to Sinch or AWS SNS\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 645 Td (* **Dead Letter Queue \(DLQ\)**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 632 Td (* Messages failing after exponential backoff retries land in DLQ for manual inspection and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 621 Td (  alerting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 608 Td (* **The Trap**: Putting all notification types into a single FIFO queue. A marketing blast) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 597 Td (  of 500,000 push notifications will delay time-critical two-factor authentication SMS codes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 586 Td (  by 30 minutes, blocking users from logging in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 573 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: How do you prevent third-party SMS gateway rate limits from) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 562 Td (  throttling your system? *\(Answer: Implement a distributed Token Bucket rate limiter in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 551 Td (  front of outbound provider HTTP clients, smoothing bursts to match provider contractual) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 540 Td (  QPS\).*) Tj ET
