BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 155 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 142 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 129 Td (* **The Phenomenon**: A high-traffic cache key \(e.g., home page catalog banner viewed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 118 Td (  10,000 users/second\) expires.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 105 Td (* Instantly, thousands of concurrent requests observe a cache miss simultaneously. All) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 94 Td (  10,000 requests query the backend database in parallel to recompute the value.) Tj ET
