BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* **Prevention Solutions**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 767 Td (* **Distributed Mutex Locking**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 754 Td (* On cache miss, the first thread acquires a distributed lock \(e.g., Redis `SET key value) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 743 Td (  NX PX 5000`\). Only the lock owner queries the database and repopulates the cache; all) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 732 Td (  other threads sleep and retry reading from the cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 719 Td (* **Early Probabilistic Expiration \(XFetch Algorithm\)**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 706 Td (* As the key approaches expiration, the system probabilistically recalculates the value in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 695 Td (  the background before it actually expires, based on read frequency and computation time:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 682 Td ($$\\Delta \\cdot \\beta \\cdot \\ln\(\\text{random}\(\)\) > \\text{remaining TTL}$$) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 666 Td (* **Background Pre-Warming / Periodic Refresh**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 653 Td (* Cache keys for hot data are set with no expiration and refreshed out-of-band by a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 642 Td (  dedicated background worker.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 629 Td (* **ASP.NET Core Output Caching**: Built-in resource locking automatically coalesces) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 618 Td (  concurrent requests for the same expired key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 605 Td (* **The Trap**: Implementing locking using local C# `lock\(obj\)` in a load-balanced web) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 594 Td (  farm. In a farm of 20 server instances, local locks still allow 20 concurrent heavy) Tj ET
