BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 780 Td (Q128: API 504 Gateway Timeout Post-Deployment Forensics) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 765 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 752 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 739 Td (* **Scenario**: Immediately after deploying a new version of an ASP.NET Core microservice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 728 Td (  to production, the reverse proxy / API gateway starts returning HTTP 504 Gateway Timeout) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 717 Td (  on $30\\%$ of customer requests.) Tj ET
