BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 130.5 Td (  rogue transaction and release locks, restoring service to all queued requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 117.5 Td (* **Permanent Fix**: Ensure all database transactions in C# are wrapped in `using var) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 106.5 Td (  transaction = await db.Database.BeginTransactionAsync\(\)`, implement lock timeouts \(`SET) Tj ET
