BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What wait types indicate database locking vs disk I/O bottlenecks) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 769 Td (  in SQL Server? *\(Answer: `LCK_M_*` indicates lock waits; `PAGEIOLATCH_*` indicates waiting) Tj ET
