BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 336 Td (Q133: Socket Exhaustion & `TIME_WAIT` Hurricane Diagnosis) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 321 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Intermediate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 308 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 295 Td (* **Scenario**: An ASP.NET Core service communicating with a third-party microservice) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 284 Td (  begins throwing `HttpRequestException: Only one usage of each socket address) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 273 Td (  \(protocol/network address/port\) is normally permitted` or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 262 Td (  `System.Net.Sockets.SocketException: Address already in use`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 249 Td (* **Root Cause: Instantiating `new HttpClient\(\)` per request**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 236 Td (* Disposing an `HttpClient` \(`using var client = new HttpClient\(\)`\) closes the HTTP client,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 225 Td (  but the underlying OS TCP socket is **not** immediately freed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 212 Td (* TCP state machine transitions the closed socket into the **`TIME_WAIT`** state \(lasting) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 201 Td (  120-240 seconds per RFC 793 standard\) to ensure any lingering delayed packets in transit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 190 Td (  on the network are not mistakenly routed to a newly opened connection on the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 179 Td (  ephemeral port.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 166 Td (* Under high load \($1,000$ requests/second\), all 65,535 outbound ephemeral TCP ports are) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 155 Td (  exhausted within minutes, starving the operating system.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 142 Td (* **Diagnostic Verification**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 129 Td (* Open terminal and run: `netstat -ano | findstr TIME_WAIT` \(Windows\) or `ss -tan 'sport =) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 118 Td (  :ephemeral' | grep TIME-WAIT | wc -l` \(Linux\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 105 Td (* Seeing tens of thousands of connections in `TIME_WAIT` confirms socket exhaustion.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 92 Td (* **Remediation**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 79 Td (* Register `IHttpClientFactory` via `builder.Services.AddHttpClient\(\)` in ASP.NET Core.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 66 Td (* `IHttpClientFactory` pools and manages `HttpMessageHandler` instances, reusing the) Tj ET
