BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 538.0 Td (* **Runtime Result**: The `try/catch` block *cannot* catch exceptions from `async void`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 527.0 Td (  methods because `async void` methods do not return a `Task` to observe or await.) Tj ET
