BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 503.0 Td (  ThreadPool. Because it is unobserved and unhandled, the CLR raises) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 492.0 Td (  `AppDomain.UnhandledException` and **abruptly terminates the entire application process**.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 479.0 Td (* **Rule**: `async void` is allowed **only** for top-level event handlers \(e.g., UI button) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 468.0 Td (  clicks\). Everywhere else, return `async Task`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 455.0 Td (* **The Trap**: Wrapping the call site `try { FireAndForgetAudit\(\); } catch` expecting it) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 444.0 Td (  to catch the failure. It will NOT catch it.) Tj ET
