BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 166.5 Td (* `c.Value` is still **`1`**!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 153.5 Td (* `\(\(Counter\)boxed\).Value` is **`2`**!) Tj ET
