BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 103.5 Td (* `boxed.Increment\(\)` mutates the value inside the boxed heap object.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 90.5 Td (* The original struct `c` on the stack remains completely untouched!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 77.5 Td (* **The Trap**: Defining mutating methods on structs and invoking them through interfaces.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 66.5 Td (  Always make structs immutable \(`readonly struct`\).) Tj ET
