BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 780 Td (* `List<T>` is **NOT** thread-safe for concurrent writes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 767 Td (* In ASP.NET Core, concurrent HTTP requests execute on separate ThreadPool threads) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 756 Td (  simultaneously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 743 Td (* When multiple threads execute `_recentOrders.Add\(\)` concurrently, they corrupt internal) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 732 Td (  array indices, overwrite elements, or trigger `IndexOutOfRangeException` / infinite loop) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 721 Td (  during internal array resizing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 708 Td (* **Fix**: Use thread-safe collections: `ConcurrentBag<T>`, `ConcurrentQueue<T>`, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 697 Td (  encapsulate with a synchronization lock / channel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 684 Td (* **The Trap**: Believing that because controllers are instantiated as Scoped per request,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 673 Td (  their `static` fields are also scoped. Static fields belong to the type definition and are) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 662 Td (  shared across all instances and all threads in the entire process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 649 Td (* **Follow-up Question**: What concurrency collection would you use if order processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 638 Td (  requires thread-safe FIFO ordering? *\(Answer: `ConcurrentQueue<T>` or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 627 Td (  `System.Threading.Channels.Channel<T>`\).*) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 45 614 Td (---) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.3 rg 45 598 Td (Q153: Code Trap: Inadequate `GetHashCode` and `Equals` Override) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 583 Td (* **Expected Depth**: Senior) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 570 Td (* **Key Answer Points**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.15 0.15 rg 52 557 Td (* **The Code**:) Tj ET
